{"about_the_game":"Primordial Pain is a brutally unforgiving, fast paced arena shooter with one key mechanic:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/124b03bf0c0ad5efb655477bf2a88dc1.avif?t=1667248141\" width=512 height=64 /></span><br>Pain serves both as your health and as a multiplier for your damage output.<br>While playing you're constantly performing an elegant dance on the fine line of maximum power and certain death.<br>To defeat the primordial horrors that lurk in the darkness and overcome the pain you must perfect the dance.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/bd851978026bf2775c960c794a93834a.poster.avif?t=1667248141\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/bd851978026bf2775c960c794a93834a.webm?t=1667248141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/bd851978026bf2775c960c794a93834a.mp4?t=1667248141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/35230dcd5e7b1e02bfd6cc69c6bc47f1.avif?t=1667248141\" width=512 height=64 /></span><br>Primordial Pain constrains you to a seemingly small arena, provides you with various different movement options and proceeds to through waves of enemies at you each requiring a different strategy to defeat.<br>You will have to experiment with every single mechanic at your disposal to discover optimal strategies or you will get overwhelmed by hordes of adversaries.<br>Survive long enough and great ancient beasts will reveal themselves.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/860489ad86b9dc39402dc5408caedb1d.poster.avif?t=1667248141\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/860489ad86b9dc39402dc5408caedb1d.webm?t=1667248141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/860489ad86b9dc39402dc5408caedb1d.mp4?t=1667248141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/a7e32e50c96586187440d5005f9e8711.avif?t=1667248141\" width=512 height=64 /></span><br>While playing you can either focus on surviving for as long as possible or to top your own highscore.<br>Whereas time constantly ticks up, your score depends on how quickly you can dispatch enemies as well as your method.<br>Playing in a stylish way will reward you with more points to be added to your score.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Behemoth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2181000/452ce2e102877197698d66c7b315659c323f54f8.jpg"},{"name":"Devourer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2181000/be9da58e43303b7eab42b6b4289b74d74b560edb.jpg"},{"name":"Absorber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2181000/2b9c134f9d539f3a791077fa0fed62123f8b0c37.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2181000?t=1667248141","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1667248141","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1667248141","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1667248141","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Primordial Pain is a brutally unforgiving, fast paced arena shooter with one key mechanic:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/124b03bf0c0ad5efb655477bf2a88dc1.avif?t=1667248141\" width=512 height=64 /></span><br>Pain serves both as your health and as a multiplier for your damage output.<br>While playing you're constantly performing an elegant dance on the fine line of maximum power and certain death.<br>To defeat the primordial horrors that lurk in the darkness and overcome the pain you must perfect the dance.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/bd851978026bf2775c960c794a93834a.poster.avif?t=1667248141\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/bd851978026bf2775c960c794a93834a.webm?t=1667248141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/bd851978026bf2775c960c794a93834a.mp4?t=1667248141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/35230dcd5e7b1e02bfd6cc69c6bc47f1.avif?t=1667248141\" width=512 height=64 /></span><br>Primordial Pain constrains you to a seemingly small arena, provides you with various different movement options and proceeds to through waves of enemies at you each requiring a different strategy to defeat.<br>You will have to experiment with every single mechanic at your disposal to discover optimal strategies or you will get overwhelmed by hordes of adversaries.<br>Survive long enough and great ancient beasts will reveal themselves.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/860489ad86b9dc39402dc5408caedb1d.poster.avif?t=1667248141\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/860489ad86b9dc39402dc5408caedb1d.webm?t=1667248141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/860489ad86b9dc39402dc5408caedb1d.mp4?t=1667248141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/extras/a7e32e50c96586187440d5005f9e8711.avif?t=1667248141\" width=512 height=64 /></span><br>While playing you can either focus on surviving for as long as possible or to top your own highscore.<br>Whereas time constantly ticks up, your score depends on how quickly you can dispatch enemies as well as your method.<br>Playing in a stylish way will reward you with more points to be added to your score.","developers":["Jan Malitschek"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181000/header.jpg?t=1667248141","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2181000/503370/d21064820b3925ace2888fa31003e741a23cc0bb/1751086378/dash_av1.mpd?t=1665663825","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2181000/503370/d21064820b3925ace